    "Every size for the App Store, Google Play, Android and the web, in one zip.": ["Todos los tamaños para App Store, Google Play, Android y la web, en un zip.","Todos os tamanhos para App Store, Google Play, Android e a web, em um zip.","Toutes les tailles pour l’App Store, Google Play, Android et le web, dans un zip.","Alle Größen für App Store, Google Play, Android und das Web in einem Zip.","App Store、Google Play、Android、ウェブ用のすべてのサイズを 1 つの zip に。","App Store、Google Play、Android 和网页所需的全部尺寸，打包在一个 zip 里。","App Store, Google Play, Android, 웹용 모든 크기를 zip 하나로."],
